flowchart TD
 S1["1. Define the service output and lifecycle boundary\nClarify the functional unit, service requirement, assets, resources, and constraints relevant to Annual Circularity Review."]
 S2["2. Apply the circularity hierarchy\nEvaluate avoidance, reduction, sharing, maintenance, repair, reuse, refurbishment, recovery, and disposal."]
