 S4["4. Compare options under uncertainty\nUse common boundaries, safety requirements, sensitivity, and non-compensatory safeguards."]
 S3 --> S4
 S5["5. Decide, contract, and monitor\nSet procurement, asset-life, take-back, disposition, annual review, and corrective-action requirements."]
 S4 --> S5
